title: We get to pretend that we do things that aren’t based on money
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

<<<
As long as money is ok, as long as there isn’t a crisis, then we get to pretend that we do things that aren’t based on money, aren’t constructed out of money, aren’t determined by money.
<<<